cascade.howTo:
The UNITE Open Call 2 for Joint Interregional Projects offers financial support for innovative digital solutions that strengthen the health equity and address the growing health workforce crisis.
 Applicants from the UNITE partner regions are invited to submit proposals using the dedicated submission system available on the UNITE Cloud .
 The UNITE partner regions include:
 - Region of Central Macedonia, Greece;
- Lombardy Region, Italy;
- Extremadura Region, Spain;
- Aragón Region, Spain;
- Scotland, United Kingdom;
- Wales, United Kingdom;
- Romania, national scope.
 Submitted proposals will be evaluated based on the pre-defined evaluation criteria and following the evaluation process described in the UNITE Call Document and  UNITE Specific Call 2 Document . 
 Applicants are strongly encouraged to carefully review the call documents to ensure compliance with the UNITE framework and regional requirements.

